      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Physics ledger (from signal_log)\nMeasured Wh integrates pack V×I over drive samples (trapezoid in spirit: per-sample power × median dt). Aero Wh assumes the **labeled default** CdA 0.575 m², ρ 1.225 kg/m³. **Rolling and grade are unknown here** — mass lives in operator config, elevation is never sent — so Residual = Measured − Aero absorbs them. For the full solver with mass, see the app ledger. Pack current is charge-positive; discharge is negative on that axis."
      },
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Honesty — ledger residuals",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
